00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:43.090
solutions might also be affected
in different context IDs,

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:48.850
so the selection stage can
also be a bottleneck here.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:52.050
There can be solutions that
are almost correct, but not

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:53.150
completely correct.

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:56.390
Yes.

00:12:56.390 --> 00:13:00.210
So the [INAUDIBLE] example
seems like a very arbitrary one.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:05.570
Do you have an experiment that
