00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:46.560
But on the question
around why is it

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:47.945
different in different contexts?

00:13:47.945 --> 00:13:49.320
The inputs are
different and then

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:51.480
the pipeline will--
the selection stage can

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:54.200
be a bottleneck, so
