01:02:51.680 --> 01:02:54.480
So there's still a lot
of headroom in chemistry.

01:02:54.480 --> 01:02:56.480
[CHUCKLES]

01:02:56.480 --> 01:02:57.460
Yes.

01:02:57.460 --> 01:02:59.500
I have a question
